    "title": "Blenheim Winery veteran chosen Monticello Wine Trail's first-ever Executive Director - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jay Hart ,\n9 hours ago CHARLOTTESVILLE, VA (CVILLE RIGHT NOW) – The Monticello Wine Trail Board has chosen one of their own to be the first to hold the newly created Executive Director position. Tracey Love started working at Blenheim Winery in 2013 as marketing, events, and distribution manager, and started working as the wine trail’s marketing coordinator a couple of years ago. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
